message: "If you use EgoForge, cite this software and retain the Humanola source dataset attribution in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md."
type: software
title: "EgoForge: Auditable Multimodal Egocentric Motion Annotation and Quality Control"
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/amemon12/egoforge"
date-released: 2026-11-19
authors:
  - name: "EgoForge contributors"
abstract: "A reproducible temporal motion annotation and quality-control pipeline over a pinned subset of an existing egocentric dataset. New labels are automatic proposals; source hand poses and recordings are inherited."
keywords:
  - egocentric video
  - temporal annotation
  - multimodal quality assurance
  - data provenance
